  "intro": {
    "title": "Es regnet, es gibt, wie geht es?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Es is 'it' for das-nouns: das Buch → es. But it also does jobs English gives to other words: es gibt (there is/are), es regnet (it's raining), wie geht es dir? (how are you?)."
    ]
  },
